  "prefLabel": "Alc 404.04 Administrative Obligations of Supervised CRSWs",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Alc 404.04 Administrative Obligations of Supervised CRSWs. The administrative obligation of the supervised CRSW during supervision shall be to:\n\n(a) Maintain records of the dates and hours they receive supervision and the name(s) of the supervisor(s);\n\n(b) On the basis of such records, prepare a cumulative statement containing the following:\n\n(1) For each week identified by calendar date, the number of hours of supervision received in each supervision session;\n\n(2) The credentials, printed name(s), signature(s) of the supervisor(s) providing the supervision, and the date the statement was signed by the supervisor; and\n\n(3) The printed name and signature(s) of the CRSW preparing the statement and the date of the signature; and\n\n(c) Maintain records of supervision for a period no less than 7 years after the termination of the supervision.\n\nSource. #12548, eff 7-1-18; ss by #14045, eff 10-7-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/alc100-500.html"
